    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASTRONAVE is a minimalistic arcade game that encapsulates the essence of shoot'em up action within an abstract black and white macrocosm. Your reflexes and precision will be put to the ultimate test. Blast through the celestial bodies with pinpoint accuracy while evading the relentless assault of spheres. Enter the flow, master the art of circular dodging and aim for the highest score as you immerse yourself in this cosmic shmup odyssey of skill and determination to finally destroy the mysterious sphere!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391090/extras/cac17e5ecf36585a42456bfde7a5f29b.avif?t=1749566172\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASTRONAVE is a minimalistic arcade game that encapsulates the essence of shoot'em up action within an abstract black and white macrocosm. Your reflexes and precision will be put to the ultimate test. Blast through the celestial bodies with pinpoint accuracy while evading the relentless assault of spheres. Enter the flow, master the art of circular dodging and aim for the highest score as you immerse yourself in this cosmic shmup odyssey of skill and determination to finally destroy the mysterious sphere!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391090/extras/cac17e5ecf36585a42456bfde7a5f29b.avif?t=1749566172\" /></span></p>",
